/-!
# Fixed half-critical payment of a native whole-residual redirect

The whole-residual redirect already generates its actual positive-time
unforced receipt and its cubic pre-quotient payment.  This module puts that
payment directly into the classical finite Galerkin enstrophy budget, with
no caller-selected margin:

```text
actual current
→ fixed half-critical crossing
  or faithful whole-residual zero
  or A_(1/2,ν) * T³ * Q / 12
       < H(actual receipt at 0) - H(actual receipt at duration).
```

Here `Q` is the full integer-frequency weighted old whole-PDE residual
quantum.  The fixed `1/2` split is internal.  The trajectory, modes,
interval, crossing branch, residual activity, and payment window are all
generated by the same native macro occurrence.
-/

